# Mega Drive, SNES and PC Engine content. `.md` is the one entry in this list
# that is ALSO an extremely common non-ROM extension -- every Markdown file in
# every repository -- so it is deliberately anchored to the roms directories
# rather than applied globally: an unqualified `*.md` here would silently stop
# this project's own README.md, TESTED.md and docs/ from ever being committed
# again, which is a far worse failure than a stray ROM being offered.
# Checked before writing it this way: the author's 100k-file collection holds
# exactly one real Markdown file, and it is not in a Mega Drive directory.
roms/**/*.md
roms/*.md
*.sfc
*.smc
*.pce
# NOT *.sgx or *.chd: koboy does not list either (SuperGrafx needs a core this
# project does not ship, PC Engine CD needs a BIOS it must not ship), so
# neither can arrive here as content koboy put there.
